  "description": "(3.3.0) Carrier-agnostic telephony contracts for CircleAI — inbound + outbound voice calls, number provisioning, call lifecycle, DTMF, call transfer. The substrate every consumer (txtMe, Panik, salon receptionist, debt-collection AI) talks to so it doesn't have to know whether the call is on Twilio, Telnyx, or Plivo. Provider adapters ship as CircleAI.Telephony.Twilio / .Telnyx / .Plivo. Null implementation included for test-host scenarios.",
